  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About&#x3a; Track B human-in-the-loop. Picks IMPS breaks at or above the HITL threshold, plus&#xd;&#xa;every amount mismatch, seals each with a SHA-256 evidence hash over its four-feed facts and&#xd;&#xa;posts the dossier to the Operations Cockpit queue for maker-checker sign-off.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Params&#x3a; Breaks file, HITL threshold (INR), Operations Cockpit queue endpoint.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Output&#x3a; HITL_Dispatch_Audit_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx (dossier, hash, HTTP outcome) attached to the result.&#xd;&#xa;Complete when all dossiers queue, Failure if any are rejected, Diverted if none qualify.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Errors&#x3a; Unreachable API rows go down the error hop to the error log and&#xd;&#xa;HITL_API_Errors_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx and end with Failure; malformed input rows also end with Failure.</note>
      <xloc>608</xloc>
      <yloc>512</yloc>
      <width>760</width>
      <heigth>254</heigth>
      <fontname>Segoe UI</fontname>
      <fontsize>11</fontsize>
      <fontbold>N</fontbold>
      <fontitalic>N</fontitalic>
      <fontcolorred>0</fontcolorred>
      <fontcolorgreen>0</fontcolorgreen>
      <fontcolorblue>0</fontcolorblue>
      <backgroundcolorred>192</backgroundcolorred>
      <backgroundcolorgreen>192</backgroundcolorgreen>
      <backgroundcolorblue>192</backgroundcolorblue>
      <bordercolorred>100</bordercolorred>
      <bordercolorgreen>100</bordercolorgreen>
      <bordercolorblue>100</bordercolorblue>
      <drawshadow>Y</drawshadow>
      <shadow_size>5</shadow_size>
    </notepad>
  </notepads>
</transformation>
